# A Little Knowledge (crystalWar 6), under Astral Flow: a level 99 Warrior in The Eldieme Necropolis [S] with
# the quest accepted at Prog 1 (GMs; missions as the main flow). Astral Flow (a GM's effect 55) is one of the
# four two-hour effects Erlene asks for: 14, finished: completed (the Grimoire and the Scholar job gesture,
# Schultz Scholar; Scholar unlocked).
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Erlene/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/14
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=378.436,-39.999,17.914 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg PillarOfHope current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
quest CrystalWar.ALittleKnowledge accepted      # a GM
charvar Quest[7][6]Prog 1                       # a GM
effect 55                                     # a GM: Astral Flow
trigger Erlene                          # 14
finish
